SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This MIT license covers the Python plugin code (`*.py`), the bundled red-team
skills under `skills/`, the test suite, and the CI configuration.

It does NOT cover the persona prompt assets under `prompt/` — those are a
derivative work of `c3cvld7aag/fujiang-dsh` and remain under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. See `LICENSE-CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.md` and `NOTICE.md`.

`upstream/` is a vendored copy of upstream artefacts and keeps its own
`upstream/LICENSE` verbatim; do not apply this MIT license to it.
